// sch_path: /home/joyen/ee5311/EE5311/assignments/assignment3/inverter.sch
subckt inverter ( y a )
//.ipin a
//.opin y
ends 

global VDD 
ground GND 
//// begin user architecture code
model vsource vsource
//// end user architecture code
